# Route: guide 14 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Human (1452
# of 1458 eligible quests, 164.9 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 35 to 36, 26
# quests, 2.7 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (The Barrens, Hillsbrad Foothills, Silverpine Forest): Ratchet ->
# Southshore -> Tarren Mill -> Darrow Hill -> Southshore -> Fenris Isle ->
# Bael Modan -> Ratchet -> Dreadmist Peak.
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): A Host of Evil (6626; Razorfen
# Battleguard 33-34, Razorfen Thornweaver 33-34, Death's Head Cultist 33-34).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Mortality Wanes (1142), Willix the Importer (1144),
# Blueleaf Tubers (1221), Blueleaf Tubers (1221), Deviate Eradication (1487),
# Deviate Eradication (1487), The Glowing Shard (6981), In the Name of the
# Light (1053), Starving Arcane (92457), Heart of Disruption (92458).

